  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Phunware is repositioning itself toward the hospitality vertical, with a planned product showcase at a major industry conference signaling go‑to‑market intent. The business recently experienced a revenue contraction after a period of growth, reflecting uneven demand patterns. Improving profitability metrics suggest better cost control, even as top‑line momentum has paused. The shift to a concentrated niche remains early, and revenue visibility is limited.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is redirecting the company toward hospitality, deploying its strengthened cash position to accelerate an AI‑enhanced platform and expand the management team. A planned investor webinar tied to product announcements underscores efforts to engage the market. Cost discipline has narrowed losses, and prior litigation headwinds have receded. Proving that this strategic pivot can deliver consistent revenue growth is the key execution challenge.",
